  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Add salt and water to a medium saucepan, cover, and bring to a boil over high heat."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash and dry the lime; zest and juice it into a small bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Once the water is boiling, stir in oats, cinnamon, and maple syrup; reduce heat to medium-low. Cover and let simmer for 3-5 minutes or until oats reach desired consistency."
    },
    {
      "text": "Add yogurt and maple syrup to the bowl with the lime zest and juice; whisk to combine."
    },
    {
      "text": "When the oats are done, stir in milk."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide oats between bowls and top with lime yogurt and pistachios. Enjoy!"
    }
